OL,3,GNEWSAWiddecombe suspect in court
OL,4,Acharged with preparing terrorist acts
OL,5,Aagainst Farage
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe man accused of murdering the former
OL,8,FMP Ann Widdecombe in July has appeared
OL,9,Fin court faced with a new allegation of
OL,10,Fpreparing terrorist acts, including
OL,11,Fagainst Reform UK leader Nigel Farage.
OL,13,FJoshua Kerry, 28, appeared in person at
OL,14,FWestminster Magistrates' Court. With a
OL,15,Fthick beard and wearing a grey
OL,16,Fsweatshirt and trousers, he spoke only
OL,17,Fto confirm his address in Rotherham and
OL,18,Fhis date of birth.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
