OL,3,GNEWSAWiddecombe suspect in court
OL,4,Acharged with preparing terrorist acts
OL,5,Aagainst Farage
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutor Kashif Malik told the court
OL,8,FKerry is alleged to have carried out
OL,9,Fonline reconnaissance of "prominent
OL,10,Fpeople and institutions... including
OL,11,Fidentifying the home address of Nigel
OL,12,FFarage".
OL,14,FHe was accompanied by four custody
OL,15,Fofficers in the dock and was remanded
OL,16,Fin custody to appear at the Old Bailey
OL,17,Fon Friday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
